# Cryptcaller Chariot: "Whenever you discard one or more cards, create that many tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens."
# Bot1's Wheel of Fortune (turn 3) makes both players discard: Bot1 its 2 remaining cards (one trigger, "that many" = 2
# tapped Zombies, CR 603.2c) and Bot2 its 7 (8 cards in its graveyard with an earlier cleanup discard; not "you", no Zombies for Bot1 from them).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Cryptcaller Chariot
Mox Ruby
Wheel of Fortune
Forest
Forest
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

